<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;UNTERWACHINGEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Unterwachingen is a municipality in the state of Baden-Württemberg, Germany, known for its recent membership in the International Telecommunication Union (ITU) and Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL TELECOMMUNICATION UNION (ITU)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ITU is a specialized agency of the United Nations responsible for issues related to information and communication technologies, with Unterwachingen becoming a member to stay at the forefront of innovation and access global resources."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BADEN-WÜRTTEMBERG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Baden-Württemberg is a state in Germany where Unterwachingen is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAYOR, HERRMANN SCHNEIDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Herrmann Schneider is the Mayor of Unterwachingen, who announced the municipality's membership in the ITU and emphasized the importance of embracing technology and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. HOULIN ZHAO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Houlin Zhao is the ITU Secretary-General, who welcomed Unterwachingen to the ITU and highlighted the alignment of their goals with the ITU's mission."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Rodriguez is the CEO of Unterwachingen-based startup, TechForge, who expressed excitement about the benefits of ITU membership for her company and the local tech sector."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHFORGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TechForge is a startup based in Unterwachingen that will benefit from ITU membership, including access to a global network of innovators and entrepreneurs."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KOMMUNALE INFORMATIONSVERARBEITUNG REUTLINGEN-ULM (KIRU)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"KIRU is a company that provides information technology services to municipalities in the region, with Unterwachingen being a member since 1992."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRESS CONFERENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A press conference was held at the Unterwachingen Town Hall to announce the municipality's membership in the ITU."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOWN HALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Town Hall is the venue where the press conference was held to announce Unterwachingen's membership in the ITU."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITU SECRETARY-GENERAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ITU Secretary-General is a high-ranking official within the ITU, responsible for overseeing the organization's operations and representing it in various capacities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECH SECTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The tech sector refers to the industries and businesses involved in the development and application of technology, which will benefit from ITU membership for Unterwachingen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GLOBAL NETWORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A global network refers to the interconnected system of individuals, organizations, and resources across the world, which TechForge will gain access to through ITU membership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOREIGN INVESTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Foreign investment refers to the flow of capital from one country to another, which is expected to increase due to Unterwachingen's ITU membership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOB CREATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Job creation refers to the process of generating new employment opportunities, which is anticipated to rise in the tech sector due to ITU membership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;5G NETWORKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"5G Networks refer to the fifth generation of wireless communication standards, which Unterwachingen will have access to through ITU membership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Artificial Intelligence refers to the development and application of intelligent machines and algorithms, which Unterwachingen will explore through ITU membership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYBERSECURITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cybersecurity refers to the practice of protecting systems, networks, and programs from digital attacks, which Unterwachingen will enhance through ITU membership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA PROCESSING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Processing refers to the manipulation and analysis of data, which KIRU provides as a service to Unterwachingen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IT CONSULTING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SERVICE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"IT Consulting refers to the provision of expert advice and guidance on information technology matters, which KIRU offers to Unterwachingen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0154</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;UNTERWACHINGEN&quot;" target="&quot;INTERNATIONAL TELECOMMUNICATION UNION (ITU)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Unterwachingen became a member of the ITU to demonstrate its commitment to innovation and access global resources."</data>
      <data key="d5">"innovation, global collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0154</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNTERWACHINGEN&quot;" target="&quot;MAYOR, HERRMANN SCHNEIDER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mayor Schneider announced the municipality's membership in the ITU and emphasized the importance of technology and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"leadership, public statement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0154</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNTERWACHINGEN&quot;" target="&quot;DR. HOULIN ZHAO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Houlin Zhao welcomed Unterwachingen to the ITU and highlighted the alignment of their goals with the ITU's mission."</data>
      <data key="d5">"welcoming, strategic alignment"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0154</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNTERWACHINGEN&quot;" target="&quot;TECHFORGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"TechForge, a local startup, will benefit from ITU membership, including access to a global network of innovators and entrepreneurs."</data>
      <data key="d5">"networking, business growth"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0154</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNTERWACHINGEN&quot;" target="&quot;KOMMUNALE INFORMATIONSVERARBEITUNG REUTLINGEN-ULM (KIRU)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Unterwachingen is a member of KIRU, a company that provides IT services to municipalities in the region, since 1992."</data>
      <data key="d5">"IT services, long-term partnership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0154</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MAYOR, HERRMANN SCHNEIDER&quot;" target="&quot;DR. MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mayor Schneider's announcement about ITU membership likely influenced Dr. Maria Rodriguez's excitement about the benefits for TechForge."</data>
      <data key="d5">"inspiration, leadership impact"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0154</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
